        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC6353877::web::018::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The two-hierarchical constraint effect and self-generated microcrack arrest improve the alloy's mechanical response.",
